#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_purchase_stock_auto_cancel.field_res_config_settings__purchase_auto_cancel
msgid ""
"When a purchase order is created from a sales order using the MTO or "
"Dropship rule for this company, and the sale order is cancelled, it will be "
"automatically cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Če se za to družbo iz prodajnega naloga ustvari nabavni nalog po pravilu MTO "
"ali Dropship in se prodajni nalog prekliče, se bo tudi nabavni nalog "
"samodejno preklical."
